# Start with a task
Who needs what information?
Write measurable acceptance criteria.

---

# Separate responsibilities
HTML: meaning
CSS: presentation
JavaScript: behaviour
Database: structured records

---

# Trace the data
Form → HTTP → Python → SQL
→ JSON → DOM → user

---

# Design for access
Labels · Semantic controls · Visible focus
Text alternatives · Clear status and errors

Test with keyboard and zoom.

---

# Relational structure
Book.category_id → Category.category_id
Join related records; parameterise values.

---

# Test every state
Loading · Results · No match · Failure

A correct query and a usable interface both matter.

---

# ALT1 evidence
User need · Schema · Actual query
Working interaction · Test record · Reflection
